WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:20.737
The king and queen sat on their thrones.

2
00:00:20.738 --> 00:00:24.306
Prince Eric stared at his lessons.

3
00:00:24.307 --> 00:00:26.778
He was grumpy.

4
00:00:26.779 --> 00:00:29.659
"Tom," he whispered.

5
00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.800
"Help me finish my lessons."

6
00:00:32.801 --> 00:00:35.748
Tom looked at the prince's paper.

7
00:00:35.749 --> 00:00:39.364
It was filled with math problems.

8
00:00:39.365 --> 00:00:45.803
"Use magic!" whispered the prince.

9
00:00:45.804 --> 00:00:48.081
Tom lifted his wand.

10
00:00:48.082 --> 00:00:52.422
"No, Tom!" The queen glared at him.

11
00:00:52.423 --> 00:00:55.985
"The prince must do his own work.

12
00:00:55.986 --> 00:00:58.990
Someday he will be the king."

13
00:00:58.991 --> 00:01:01.288
Prince Eric grinned.

14
00:01:01.289 --> 00:01:05.859
"Then I won't have to work!" he said.

15
00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:09.297
The king frowned. "What?"

16
00:01:09.298 --> 00:01:13.099
"Kings work very hard!" Tom said quickly.

17
00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:16.024
The king puffed out his chest.

18
00:01:16.025 --> 00:01:19.541
"Indeed!" he said proudly.

19
00:01:19.542 --> 00:01:21.562
The prince shrugged.

20
00:01:21.563 --> 00:01:25.163
"Then I won’t be the king," he said.

21
00:01:25.164 --> 00:01:27.620
The queen scowled.

22
00:01:27.621 --> 00:01:32.536
"Finish your lessons," she said.

23
00:01:32.537 --> 00:01:37.420
"I won't!" the prince cried.

24
00:01:37.421 --> 00:01:40.023
He ran from the room.

25
00:01:40.024 --> 00:01:43.248
The queen sighed.

26
00:01:43.249 --> 00:01:57.943
"Wizard, bring him back," she said.

27
00:01:57.944 --> 00:02:01.822
Tom went to the prince's room.

28
00:02:01.823 --> 00:02:09.335
The window was open.

29
00:02:09.336 --> 00:02:20.945
"I see a note!" Cat said.

30
00:02:20.946 --> 00:02:26.703
Tom brought the note to the queen.

31
00:02:26.704 --> 00:02:29.751
"What does it say?" the king asked.

32
00:02:29.752 --> 00:02:31.949
The queen read the note:

33
00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:34.495
I want an easy job.

34
00:02:34.496 --> 00:02:38.940
So Frog and I are running away.

35
00:02:38.941 --> 00:02:41.896
The queen pulled out her handkerchief.

36
00:02:41.897 --> 00:02:46.399
"Find the prince, Tom!" she sobbed loudly.

37
00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:57.298
"Or don’t come back!"

